window.products.push({"id":180289,"name":"Mini Food Processor Vegetable Chopper, Luckyox 2.5 Cup 250w Baby Food Processor, Small Electric Chopper Mincer for Onion Veggie Meat Garlic and Meal P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rJqNjZ8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ONE BUTTON CONTROL - The button is on the top of the host. Press the button to chop, press and hold it to mix, mince, and purée. This vegetable chopper can quickly chop and dice your fruits and vegetables with a simple push of a button. The baby food processor effectively speeds up your prep work, allowing you more time to spend with family or relax. Easy and Safe. POWERFUL & SAFE - LUCKYOX small food processor has a 250-watt motor and 2 SUS420 S-shaped blades that can quickly process meat, vegetables, and fruits, giving you an even result in seconds. Come with 4 reusable blade guards to protect the blade and you from harm. Besides, this garlic mincer has built-in over-temperature protection(149℉) to extend its service life. 2.5 CUP CAPACITY with Marks - 2.5 Cup bowl with measurement marks that you don’t have to dirty measuring cups when prepping recipes. Come with a silicone lid to cover the bowl, and keep your pre-prepared food fresh and healthy in the fridge. This electric food chopper bowl is made of low borosilicate glass that is scratch- and stain-resistant. As a work bowl, its max capacity is 2 Cup. DETACHABLE & EASY TO CELAN - With a demountable design, this baby food blender is easy to clean without hidden corners. Just rinse them(Except the host) in running water and let them dry. Attach a spatula and small brush to help you remove food from the glass bowl. The O-ring and nonslip pad can effectively reduce the noise, be sure they are mounted well when working. COMPACT & MULTI-PURPOSE - Designed to deal with smaller quantities, this onion chopper electric is compact and countertop friendly. The mini food chopper is ideal for mixing salad dressings, sauces, and condiments; making fresh salsas; dicing onions, peppers, garlic, and other small vegetables; chopping fresh herbs, and more. Save your precious time in the kitchen. The whole machine is BPA FREE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rJqNjZ8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luckyox","source_asin":"B09R1JBT2J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-180289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R1JBT2J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R1JBT2J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":180290,"name":"Mr. Light Seneca Funkin 9\" x 8.5\" x 8.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-zzpBTDTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Funkins are synthetic pumpkins that are carefully crafted and painted by hand to look just like real pumpkins.They can be carved and lit to look like spooky works of art just like pumpkins. They are made hollow so there is no scooping of seeds necessary and they never ever rot, so carvings last forever! A uniform surface with nice ridges for intricate carvings, the Seneca Funkin is an ideal size for a centerpiece. A perfect candy orange hue and striking realism. The walls of a Funkin are generally about one half of an inch thick so they are strong enough to last for years to come. Carve Funkins just like you carve pumpkins. Once your Funkin is carved, light it up with any electric light under 5 watts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-zzpBTDTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Light","source_asin":"B003I4EB1E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-180290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003I4EB1E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003I4EB1E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
