window.products.push({"id":180399,"name":"Solid White Queen Attached Waterbed Sheet set 100% Cotton By sheetsnthings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Nq7HddjuL._AC_.jpg","description":"Percale stands for the weaving process in which the fabric is woven by. In percale the yarns are woven in one over one, unlike Sateen where its four over one. The one over one (percale) weave creates a much even, stronger, denser & softer fabric, which can stand the test of time and gets a better and better feel the more you wash it. Its just like your favorite old shirt, the more its laundered the softer and durable it gets. Finally, this superior weave, woven in the best authentic way is done using the best cotton in the world. Egyptian cotton, its not just cotton grown in Egypt - it is a particular type of long-staple cotton originally grown along the Nile. Egyptian cotton has the longest fibers. That is, when you pull the cotton from the cotton plant and remove the seeds and waxes, Egyptian cotton has longer fibers available for spinning into yarn than other cottons. When intertwining strands of yarn to make a larger product, long-staple cotton has fewer connection points, and therefore a greater percentage of area has the natural softness of the cotton.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Nq7HddjuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxury Egyptian Cotton","source_asin":"B0038R9JTA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-180399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0038R9JTA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0038R9JTA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
