window.products.push({"id":180461,"name":"3 Pack Ice Cube Trays, Silicone Honeycomb Shape Ice Cube Molds wih Lids Make 111 Ice Cube for Whiskey, Cocktail, Stackable Flexible, BPA Free (Purple+","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619cGL1QucL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"AS PRODUCT: The ice maker is made of Silica gel, which has adsorption capacity itself. It will absorb the impurities in water. When it was used to make ice, the white floccule will appear on the surface of ice cubes. The white floccule is consist of calcium, magenesium and other impurities existed in water, it will does no harm to human body. Solution： 1. Use pure or distilled water is best 2. Dip the ice cubes  in water for a while before use it. Then the floccule will stay in water. Release Ice: You'd better not add too much water in case the ice and the cover sticking together.It is recommended that you place the tray for a period of time and wait for the ice to melt a little before releasing the ice will be easier. High Quality Trays： Each tray makes 37 ice cubes.Ice cube trays made of food grade silicone,it’s BPA free and safe for our healthy. Stackable Ice Trays： Each tray has a lid that can be stacked.to avoid the smell from the fridge .silicone ice cube trays can save some room in the refrigerator. It does not take up a lot of space NOTE: 1 . Do not use metal brush to clean these ice cube trays. 2. Ice is usually tightly attached to the mold when first taken from the refrigerator, we highly                        recommend you to wait for a while, which will make it much easier to push out the ice cubes. 3. Do not clean the ice cube trays with strong detergent in case they get corroded . 4. Please wipe ou","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619cGL1QucL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONMIER","source_asin":"B07WVXV5L8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-180461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WVXV5L8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WVXV5L8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
