window.products.push({"id":180533,"name":"Leggett & Platt Marlo Metal Headboard Panel with Squared Finial Posts, Burnished Black Finish, California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OH5TCaJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Marlo delivers a sense of sophistication blended with rustic charm, creating an interesting visual that grabs the attention. This bedroom piece is equally at home in a contemporary setting, making it a great versatile addition to any master suite or guestroom in the home. Constructed of carbon steel for strong support and long life, the 52-inch headboard has a (3) step Burnished Black finish. The circular design within the headboard panel is offset by the straight line of the top rail, and square side posts are topped with flat, square finials. The sturdy headboard is still functional to lean upon while reading a good book or returning a few e-mails before going to bed. The Marlo headboard will transform a room from ordinary into something interesting and sophisticated, while providing a calming retreat you’ll want to utilize for more than just sleeping. This is a King sized headboard and includes modifying plates to fit California King sized bed frames. This unit measures 52-inches (H) x 77.5-inches (W) x 1.5-inches (L), includes a headboard panel, instructions, and hardware bag with everything needed for bed assembly. The Fashion Bed Group Marlo Headboard comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. The Fashion Bed Group, a division of globally diversified Leggett & Platt Inc., is an industry leader in the production of fashionable beds, adjustable bed bases, top of bed textiles, bedding support and barstools. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Fashion Bed Group stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes and innovative designs to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OH5TCaJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B01D5T6R9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-180533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D5T6R9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D5T6R9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
