window.products.push({"id":180543,"name":"Executive Office Desk Chair High Back Adjustable Ergonomic Managerial Rolling Swivel Task Chair Computer PU Leather Home Office Desk Chairs with Lumba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FWWHMzdIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Improves Productivity -- The brown leather executive office chair with height adjuster adjusts to the height of your desk with a seat height that can be adjusted from 19.5\" to 23.4\". This rolling desk chair with double upholstered seat cushions allows you to sit comfortably at your desk while working, studying or enjoying your passion for gaming. Maximize your performance at home or in the workplace with a large, wide, comfortable high-back computer chair with wheels. Built For Comfort -- This home office desk chair is designed to enhance the sitting posture of office workers and help them avoid stiffness, pain and discomfort in the neck and back. This big and tall office chair features an ergonomic S-shaped arch-back design that provides optimal neck and lumbar support. The tilt tension knob underneath the seat adjusts the flexibility of the lumbar support office chair to rock backward, with a tilt angle range of 90° to 110° to help relax back muscles. Luxury Look Of Leather -- High-quality PU leather headrest, breathable backrest, thick seating cushion, high resilience foam to allow you to sit comfortably for a long time. Soft leather cushion for armrests is durable and easy to clean. It is resistant to corrosion, stains, water, fading and scratches, making it a top choice for upscale conference room office chairs. The elegant, modern and stylish leather office chair is a great gift for office workers, friends, gamers or students. Sturdy & Durable -- Our modern desk chairs with arms offer a heavy-duty durable nylon base, safety gas lift and rolling casters, they can support adults up to 250 pounds. High back office chairs match with other high-quality office accessories and strictly meets BIFMA Standard to maximally ensure your safety. 360-degree swivel multi-directional wheels ensure smooth-rolling for longer periods of time, providing freedom of movement and the convenience of communicating with others. Easy To Install -- The tall adjustable office chair comes with all hardware and necessary tools. Most people can follow the assembly video we've uploaded and have it up and running in about 15-20 minutes. This heavy duty office chair is suitable for offices, game rooms, living rooms, bedrooms, dens and more. It will make your space more modern and elegant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FWWHMzdIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUNMOS","source_asin":"B09KSV4KSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-180543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KSV4KSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KSV4KSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
