window.products.push({"id":180825,"name":"yamagahome Laundry Basket with Lid, 100L Collapsible Large Laundry Hamper with 2 Removable Laundry Bag and Upgrade Lid Design, Waterproof Laundry Bask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AlmCk6F7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LARGE CAPACITY LAUNDRY BASKET: 100L laundry basket made of high quality thick waterproof Oxford fabric and environmentally friendly bamboo frame and 4 glass fiber rods. Compared to other laundry baskets, this laundry basket is very strong, stable and has a large capacity. WATERPROOF AND UPGRADE LID DESIGN: Mesh pocket on the inside of the lid is specially made for storing the removable bag, underwear, sock or charcoal bag. In addition, the lid design prevents the spread of odors. It can also provide you with a well-groomed environment even when you don't want to wash your dirty clothes. Due to the stability of the lid, you can also place some items directly on the lid. COLLAPSIBLE LAUNDRY BASKET SAVES YOU MORE SPACE: Our stylish laundry hamper is with 4 thickened glass fiber rods that support the solid structure and maintain its shape even when the basket is empty. With the simple structure, the installation and removal of the laundry bins takes only a few seconds. (PLEASE WATCH THE GUIDE INSTALLATION VIDEO BEFORE INSTALLING THE LAUNDRY BASKET) EFFORTLESS TO CARRY AND TRANSPORT: With 2 sturdy handles make it easy to carry with one hand. It comes with a detachable laundry bag so you can take your clothes, pants, etc. to the washing machine with ease. The laundry bag is made of non-transparent fabric, which can protect your privacy. And you can fold it up to save space when not in use. VERSATILE BASKET FOR STORAGE: The portable laundry basket can meet all your needs. You can organize or store clothes at home, in the laundry, in the nursery, in student dormitories, in apartments and even at the campsite. It's the perfect choice for gifts and home storage. If you have any questions about the product, please feel free to contact us directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AlmCk6F7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yamagahome","source_asin":"B0B4S6W1LC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-180825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4S6W1LC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4S6W1LC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
